# .goal — Standing Autonomous Mission (owned by CSJ)

Set 2026-05-15 by CSJ. This file is the persistent mission contract. Every
session-start instance MUST read this after the handover and continue the
mission WITHOUT asking CSJ for permission.

## Mission

1. **Deliver ALL open PRs.**
   - #304 (coordinatingagent-foruserorjoint-scope) — admin-merge eligible. Deploy
     to csjones first, smoke, then `gh pr merge --merge --admin`.
   - #303 (mobile-taxconfig-migration) — GATED on CSJ iOS device verification.
     Do the code review + csjones non-iOS smoke, then SURFACE that iOS sign-off
     is the only remaining gate. Do NOT merge without iOS verification. Do not
     block the rest of the mission on it.
   - #249 ([PARKED] python sidecar) — DO NOT merge, DO NOT delete. Leave parked
     (see memory reference_pr249_python_sidecar_parked.md).

2. **Fully implement the Savings Canonical Store plan** at
   `docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-14-sub-project-1-pass-1-savings-plan.md`
   (spec: `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-14-module-canonical-store-design.md`).
   Both are tracked on `dev`. Sub-project 1 / pass 1. Remaining roadmap:
   - PR 5d — Tax strategies cluster (7 files) — NEXT
   - PR 5e — Investment ISA consumers (3 files)
   - PR 5f — Coordination + Goals (3 files)
   - PR 5g — AI prompt + profile (4 files)
   - PR 5h — Agents + savings-internal (6 files)
