## Exit condition

This mission is complete only when: all PR-roadmap items (5d→5h, 6, 7, 8) are
merged to dev, #304 is merged, #303 is surfaced for iOS sign-off, and a
dev → main release has shipped the security fix. Until then, every fresh
instance keeps going.
